The TSG file layout implemented here was learned by reading the source of
pytsg (https://github.com/Geological-Survey-of-Western-Australia/pytsg),
Copyright (c) Geological Survey of Western Australia, MIT License, and was
then checked against real NVCL HyLogger packages (see docs/tsg-format.md and
VERIFY.md). No pytsg code is included in this crate. pytsg is used, unmodified,
only as the reference reader in verify/compare.py, which is not part of the
published crate.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the makers of The Spectral
Geologist (TSG), the Geological Survey of Western Australia, or AuScope / the
National Virtual Core Library (NVCL).

No spectral data are distributed with this repository. The tests generate
small synthetic files at run time. The README examples and VERIFY.md quote a
few values from public HyLogger datasets of the Geological Survey of Western
Australia and the other state and territory geological surveys, accessed
through AuScope's National Virtual Core Library (NVCL).
